    "title": "Describe a near miss with 差点儿 or 差一点儿",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-stance-p15-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe a near miss with 差点儿 or 差一点儿",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "This places an outcome close to happening. Check the event and its negation against the context; a near miss is not automatically an event that occurred. 差一点儿 is the full variant of 差点儿.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "今天早上我差点儿忘了带书，后来还是带了书。",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān zǎoshang wǒ chàdiǎnr wàng le dài shū ， hòulái háishi dài le shū 。",
                "meaning": "This morning I almost forgot to bring the book, but I did bring it in the end.",
                "audio": "20c853f583df3226a7a9b99eb8fcd3143192cb60e2c79bc832b2c3538774fd28"
              },
              {
                "text": "我差点儿没来，最后还是来了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chàdiǎnr méi lái ， zuìhòu háishi lái le 。",
                "meaning": "I almost failed to come, but I came in the end.",
                "audio": "96cdb507cdffd537071b4d1f124e9c1d5594074f8e8ef2e64f4c4244e7ea5c7a"
              }
            ]
          },
